EF AI Workspace: PowerPoint downloads with the guide's presentation backgrounds (visual identity guide v01, p93:
title, content and closing slides on the brand's backgrounds). Owner decision 2026-10-26.

- Brand files (utils/efaiwBrandAssets.ts): two of the guide's backgrounds, the original JPEG files from
  brand/assets: EF-BG-09 (blue, the radial on the left) and EF-BG-07 (blue, a faint radial at the bottom left).
  Fetched with the font and logos, but on their own: if they fail, the deck keeps the font and logo.
- Title slide (utils/efaiwPptx.ts): EF-BG-09 as the slide background (a background, not a picture, so nothing on the
  slide moves it); the title, green rule and subtitle on its calm right side, from 45% of the width; the white logo at
  the top right as before. The title steps down to 32 pt over 44 characters and 28 pt over 85 on that narrower side.
  The background is not mirrored for English: images do not follow the reading direction.
- Closing slide: a last `## الخلاصة` / `## الخطوات التالية` (as the brand skill asks; also الخاتمة, Summary,
  Conclusion, Next steps, numbered or not) that fits one slide and has text only: EF-BG-07 behind it, white title and
  text, green rule, bullets and subheadings, links white, the slide number in the guide's light blue C3C9EC. Without
  the backgrounds it is solid primary blue, like the title slide.
- Content slides stay white, as the brand reference recommends for dense content.
- Tests: utils/__tests__/efaiwBrandAssets.test.ts (backgrounds, closing slide, fallbacks, titles that do not close).

